{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AzDxLEAueQPrAKG1mkJGv7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_1/projects/cost-verify-agent-rl/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# cost-verify-agent-rl — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 23:52 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP: 进入 research phase, 新 framing + experiment plan 完成\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nTraining interactive agents for selective self-verification via RL. Dual contribution:\\\\n1. **Training methodology**: Episode-level credit assignment is critical for multi-turn RL (step-independent catastrophically collapses)\\\\n2. **Selective verification**: Action-change as intrinsic reward for learning WHEN to verify\\\\n\\\\n详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n🔬 **Research Phase** (MVP 通过 2026-05-16, D053)\\\\n\\\\n### MVP 结果总结\\\\n- exp029 episode-level GRPO: step 5 val = 25% (2x baseline 12.5%) ✅\\\\n- exp028c step-independent (h=2): step 10 val = 0% (catastrophic collapse) ❌\\\\n- 机制: gamma^49 = 7.7%, 长 horizon credit assignment 完全失效\\\\n\\\\n### 当前状态\\\\n- exp029 训练状态待确认（registry auto-watchdog 标记 failed，可能误判）\\\\n- paper_framing.md 已重写（dual contribution framing）\\\\n- experiment_plan.yaml 已重写（16 experiments, 918 GPU-h total）\\\\n- Dream simulate 待完成\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 确认 exp029 训练是否仍在运行，报告最新 step/metrics\\\\n- [ ] 如训练已死：重启 + 部署 tatsu parallel patch\\\\n- [ ] Dream simulate 完成后：审阅 + 决定 P0 实验启动顺序\\\\n- [ ] 启动 plan_002 (h-sweep) 和 plan_003 (multi-seed) — 可并行\\\\n- [ ] plan_004 credit assignment analysis (分析/绘图，低 GPU)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配：bjb1-17606 cuda:0,1（2x RTX PRO 6000 96GB）\\\\n- P0 预算：268 GPU-h (~6 days)\\\\n- P0+P1 预算：652 GPU-h (~14 days)\\\\n- 全部：918 GPU-h (~18 days)\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. **收敛上限**: exp029 step 5=25%，能否达 40%+ 支撑 cost-efficiency story？\\\\n2. **Episode-level novelty**: reviewer 可能认为 \\\\\\\"episode-level RL is obvious\\\\\\\" — h-sweep + 机制分析是关键防御\\\\n3. **Phase B 可行性**: 如果收敛后 success < 40%，selective verification story 弱 → 退到 Plan A (pure methodology paper)\\\\n\\\\n## 竞争格局\\\\n| 系统 | 方法 | ALFWorld | 差异 |\\\\n|------|------|----------|------|\\\\n| Self-Guide (2026) | Always-on verification | 72.7% | 我们做 selective |\\\\n| ARES (2603.07915) | SFT router | 52.7% token↓ | SFT vs RL |\\\\n| RAGEN (2025) | GRPO for agents | varies | 默认 step-independent |\\\\n| Thinkless (NeurIPS'25) | RL control token | reasoning | 同方法论不同域 |\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D054 | 2026-05-16 | Post-MVP framing pivot: dual contribution (episode | exp029_episode_level, exp028c_selfguide_recipe |\\\\n| D053 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 通过：episode-level GRPO step 5 val=25%（2x baseli | exp029_episode_level, exp028c_selfguide_recipe |\\\\n| D052 | 2026-05-16 | exp028c 终止：step 10 val success=0%（灾难性崩溃），MVP 确认失败。 | exp028c_selfguide_recipe, exp027_stable_grpo, exp026_step_independent_grpo |\\\\n| D051 | 2026-05-16 | Setup 审计发现 exp028c 非 Self-Guide 有效复现：step-independ | exp028c_selfguide_recipe, exp027_stable_grpo, exp026_step_independent_grpo |\\\\n| D050 | 2026-05-15 | 停止 exp028a（确认与 exp027 功能等价），根因 #2 也被否定，下一步全面对齐 Sel | exp027, exp028a |\\\\n| D049 | 2026-05-15 | D046: SFT必要性确认 + 下一步双GPU并行策略（D诊断→A+C并行） | exp021, exp027, D046 |\\\\n| D048 | 2026-05-15 | exp028a 采用 SFT checkpoint + invalid_action_penalty | exp028_prereq, exp021, exp027 |\\\\n| D047 | 2026-05-15 | 暂停 exp028a 最终定参，等零样本 eval 确认 Qwen3-1.7B base 能力后再决 | exp028a, exp027_stable_grpo, exp028_prereq_zeroshot_instruct |\\\\n| D046 | 2026-05-15 | 继续 Phase A：exp028a Instruct 冷启动 + invalid_action_p | exp027_stable_grpo, exp028_prereq_zeroshot_instruct, exp028a |\\\\n| D045 | 2026-05-15 | exp027 判定 MVP 未通过：train success 13.28%（step 4），pas | exp027_stable_grpo |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3249, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NCJRCoJ2jrVUmWHu